Scope: actual HTML bytes came from root's recorded production export; this review parses those bytes but does not rerun Rust. Root's pending/new browser and current public GitHub navigation are not counted here. No human screen-reader operation, Pages deployment or T21/T16 completion is claimed. The candidate was checkpointed as 4895c1a during review without byte changes. The initial independent Markdown helper used default HTML escaping and therefore rendered metadata/anchors as literal paragraphs; switching the parser to interpret its real HTML blocks corrected the helper. No production content or expected semantic values changed. Snapshot files remain UTF-8 bytes despite console display encoding artifacts.
